      "content": "that makes sense from an environmental standpoint, but people are really worried about the immediate fallout. some say that pushing this too fast is basically irresponsible because it'll crush working class families with high heating and fuel costs while the green tech isn't even ready to scale yet. isn't it more logical to take a slower, more cautious approach to protect the economy first?",
